<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch trade balance figures postponed.</title>
<headline>Dutch trade balance figures postponed.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said on Thursday that publication of Dutch trade balance figures for June 1996, which was due on September 6, had been postponed until further notice.</p>
<p>The delay was caused by technical problems, it said.</p>
<p>The bureau added it will announce a new publication date on Friday when it will publish its planned schedule of Dutch economic indicators for next week.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000</p>
